@startuml esp2_temperature
title ESP2 - Temperature/Humidity (DHT22) + heater relay

participant "Home Assistant" as HA
participant "MQTT broker" as BROKER
participant "mqtt_wrap" as MQTT
participant "climate.c" as CLIM
participant "poll_task\n(FreeRTOS)" as TASK
participant "dht22.c" as DHT
participant "Heater GPIO" as GPIO

== Discovery (on connect) ==
MQTT -> CLIM: on_connect()
CLIM -> BROKER: subscribe home/temperature/heater/set
CLIM -> BROKER: publish sensor/temperature + sensor/humidity config (retain)
CLIM -> BROKER: publish switch/heater config (retain)
BROKER -> HA: entities appear

== Periodic sensor read (every publish_ms) ==
TASK -> CLIM: poll_task()
CLIM -> DHT: dht22_read(pin, &t, &h)
DHT -> DHT: bit-bang 40 bits + checksum
DHT --> CLIM: ESP_OK, t, h
CLIM -> CLIM: build JSON (cJSON)
CLIM -> BROKER: publish home/temperature/sensor/state = {temperature,humidity} (retain)
BROKER -> HA: sensor values update

== Heater control ==
HA -> BROKER: home/temperature/heater/set = "ON"
BROKER -> MQTT: MQTT_EVENT_DATA
MQTT -> CLIM: on_message(...,"ON")
CLIM -> GPIO: gpio_set_level(heater, ON ^ active_low)
CLIM -> BROKER: publish home/temperature/heater/state = "ON" (retain)
@enduml
